{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊————阿嚏！啊～好冷……」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1427", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你也别嫌我多管闲事，你就不能控制一下打喷嚏的样子吗……」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": "「……你也别嫌我多管闲事，你就不能控制一下打喷嚏的样子吗……」", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那种娘炮的事我才不会做」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1428", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早上，久违地和纱凪两个人待在活动室。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前还经常这样的啊。", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近我和她却不怎么碰得上。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「冷的话，就把外套穿上吧」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「穿上太臃肿了」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1429", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可是，如果感冒了不就捡了芝麻丢了西瓜吗」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「校服外面还套一件太麻烦了」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1430", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是这都嫌麻烦，\\n那你干嘛还加入喵咪社」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「要是这都嫌麻烦，那你干嘛还加入喵咪社」", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1431", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，实际上是为什么」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概是对别人开不了口的原因吧。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "难道是、是跟濑名同学那样要风度不要温度……", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「绝对，不会跟任何人说？」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1432", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，当然」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1433", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一边打着哆嗦搓着手，一边还哈着气。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着就觉得可怜啊……", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「其实我家附近的老奶奶……」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1434", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「附近的老奶奶怎么了」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……每天早上，都在家门前扫地。她看到我都会对我说」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "「……每天早上，都在家门前扫地。她看到我都会对我说」", "plain_idx": 218, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1436", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱总是这么有精神呀……」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1437", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯姆嗯姆，然后呢」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋，人家老奶奶都这么夸我了，那我大冬天不也得穿半袖短裙才行了么」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "「笨蛋，人家老奶奶都这么夸我了，那我大冬天不也得穿半袖短裙才行了么」", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1438", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老奶奶很期待我的。所以我才要一直在她面前维持精神的形象」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "「老奶奶很期待我的。所以我才要一直在她面前维持精神的形象」", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1439", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是冬天穿了外套」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1440", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不就再也听不到老奶奶对我说“纱纱总是这么有精神”了吗」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "「那不就再也听不到老奶奶对我说“纱纱总是这么有精神”了吗」", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1441", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呃……这要怎么办啊。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可能老奶奶脑回路太奇怪，又或者是有什么误会……", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "可能老奶奶脑回路太奇怪，又或者是有什么误会……", "plain_idx": 233, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……总之，不愧是她呀。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「烦死了，想笑就给我笑。都跟你说了我不想解释这件事……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「烦死了，想笑就给我笑。都跟你说了我不想解释这件事……」", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1442", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜——」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0386", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你……熊喵在这呀。冷死了快让我抱抱～」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1443", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜溜？！」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0387", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊……软软的，暖呼呼的……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1444", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0388", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看着用脸蹭着怀里熊喵的纱凪，想到只有自己穿着外套，便觉得有些不好意思。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "我看着用脸蹭着怀里熊喵的纱凪，想到只有自己穿着外套，便觉得有些不好意思。", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇啊？！你干嘛啊？！」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1445", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没干嘛，看你很冷就想把外套借给你」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": "「没干嘛，看你很冷就想把外套借给你」", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我刚想把衣服给她披上，她嗖地一下就躲开了。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁要你的外套。我有熊喵就够了，你穿着吧」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「谁要你的外套。我有熊喵就够了，你穿着吧」", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1446", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，你感冒才刚治好吧。别着凉了」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": "「但是，你感冒才刚治好吧。别着凉了」", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1447", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「穿上，纱凪」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1448", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这固执的性格什么时候能改改啊……」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我又不是因为喜欢才这样」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1449", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是在自言自语似的，她的表情缓和了下来。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此，她也完全没有要披上外套的意思。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有女朋友的男人，不要随便关心别的女性」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "「有女朋友的男人，不要随便关心别的女性」", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1450", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你已经和美羽学姐在交往了吧」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1451", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你发现了啊……」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那可不」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1452", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我都做好被她一个劲发牢骚的觉悟了，可她现在却很平静。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "我都做好被她一个劲发牢骚的觉悟了，可她现在却很平静。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0389", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我没事」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1453", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她跟抱在胸前的熊喵说着，然后轻轻把它放在桌上。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说实话，我本以为你会更反对一些」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1454", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我入社的时候，你还那么强烈地反对……」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算是现在，你待在这里我也不开心」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1455", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那你为什么不生气」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为没有理由生气」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1456", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1457", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然不甘心，但我觉得你配得上美羽学姐……」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "「虽然不甘心，但我觉得你配得上美羽学姐……」", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1458", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "之前一直没法跟大家坦白我和美羽学姐的事情。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最主要的原因就是纱凪的存在。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想，她肯定不会接受我和美羽学姐之间的关系……", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "我想，她肯定不会接受我和美羽学姐之间的关系……", "plain_idx": 293, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概，美羽学姐也是最想得到来自纱凪的祝福吧。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "大概，美羽学姐也是最想得到来自纱凪的祝福吧。", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感受到了她们之间的羁绊，同时我也很羡慕她们之间的关系。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "我感受到了她们之间的羁绊，同时我也很羡慕她们之间的关系。", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「该说谢谢的是我」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1459", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾你教会了我很多。多亏了你，我似乎能成为一个“好女人”了」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「新吾你教会了我很多。多亏了你，我似乎能成为一个“好女人”了」", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1460", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我觉得，现在的纱凪就是个好女人」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼，你了解我什么」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1461", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也是啊……我好像对你完全不了解」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "「也是啊……我好像对你完全不了解」", "plain_idx": 304, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，我知道有一个温柔的女孩子明明得了哮喘，却还是为了学姐养了两只猫」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "「但是，我知道有一个温柔的女孩子明明得了哮喘，却还是为了学姐养了两只猫」", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1462", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你别总勉强自己啊。我自己小时候也得过哮喘」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "「你别总勉强自己啊。我自己小时候也得过哮喘」", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道哮喘发病有多难受」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1463", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「行了，我去找下校长，看她能不能把闲置的火炉借给我们」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "「行了，我去找下校长，看她能不能把闲置的火炉借给我们」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……加油」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1464", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要加油给美羽学姐带来幸福哦」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1465", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪……」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我才不是在支持你」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1466", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「本来，我祈祷的就是美羽学姐能幸福」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1467", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对了……给美羽学姐的圣诞礼物，你买了吗？」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": "「对了……给美羽学姐的圣诞礼物，你买了吗？」", "plain_idx": 323, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1468", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直到她说起，我都完全不记得这回事。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是啊，快到圣诞节了……", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……男人都是这种东西。反正你还什么都没打算的吧」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「唉……男人都是这种东西。反正你还什么都没打算的吧」", "plain_idx": 328, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1469", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我等会就琢磨下」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真没办法啊。嗯——今年的结业式是21号啊……」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1470", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好。开完结业式，就去买礼物咯」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1471", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃……去买礼物，我们一起去？」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我完全信不过你的品味」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1472", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「第一次和男朋友过圣诞节，可绝对不能让她失望啊——」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "「第一次和男朋友过圣诞节，可绝对不能让她失望啊——」", "plain_idx": 338, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1473", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，真不好意思啊，放假了还要你来陪……」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我刚不都说了不是为了你啊——」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1474", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「痛？！」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她重重地在我肩膀上来了一下，脸上浮现出恶意满满的坏笑。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼哼哼，血色圣诞要开幕了……」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1475", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，这发展不对劲……", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊？圣诞节」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1780", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。平安夜，你有空吗」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……不好意思。那天我要打工……」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": "「啊……不好意思。那天我要打工……」", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1781", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那25号有空吗」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那天下午也要打工」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1782", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗……」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我本想着早点跟学姐约好，没想到被捷足先登了。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "我本想着早点跟学姐约好，没想到被捷足先登了。", "plain_idx": 358, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真遗憾啊。我还想和学姐一起过圣诞节来着的……", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「平安夜那天，等我打完工后行吗？虽然那时候有点晚了……」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": "「平安夜那天，等我打完工后行吗？虽然那时候有点晚了……」", "plain_idx": 360, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1783", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我没关系的，可你不就太辛苦了？工作完还来见我……」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": "「我没关系的，可你不就太辛苦了？工作完还来见我……」", "plain_idx": 362, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，我没关系。时间再短，我也想见你呢」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": "「不，我没关系。时间再短，我也想见你呢」", "plain_idx": 363, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1784", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐……」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯哼哼，谢谢你来邀请我」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1785", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在我有时会想。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有这么一位女朋友，会不会是我在做梦。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": "有这么一位女朋友，会不会是我在做梦。", "plain_idx": 369, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，眼前学姐的笑容可是毋庸置疑的现实。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以及那触手可及的温暖小手。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐，对不起」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1786", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我喜欢美羽学姐。而且一定是让你觉得烦人的那种喜欢」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": "「我喜欢美羽学姐。而且一定是让你觉得烦人的那种喜欢」", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1787", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不知怎地突然就想对学姐说声“喜欢你”了。所以，对不起」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": "「……不知怎地突然就想对学姐说声“喜欢你”了。所以，对不起」", "plain_idx": 377, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我说得前言不搭后语。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一边说喜欢还一边道歉，真是莫名其妙。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管如此……", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要是这么说了，那我也好想向你倾诉我对你的爱了～」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "「你要是这么说了，那我也好想向你倾诉我对你的爱了～」", "plain_idx": 381, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1788", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有这么一个向我倾诉爱意的恋人，我可真是太幸福了。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "有这么一个向我倾诉爱意的恋人，我可真是太幸福了。", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
